  triage:fixCommit "c0afd678d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: new #[test] caller_team_precedes_ambient_team_for_doctor_scope sets ATM_TEAM to a conflicting config-resolved team via EnvGuard, passes caller_team explicitly on the query with no team_override, and asserts report.team_scope == \"single\" with member_roster.team == the caller team (not the ambient-config team) -- directly isolating the new precedence branch that the prior tests only exercised incidentally. Personally-run cargo test -p agent-team-mail-core green (597 tests) at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
